{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launching Over It</strong> is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer\u2019s childhood memories. To reach the end, you\u2019ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles\u2014by launching a ball. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Golfing Over It with Alva Majo</i>, this game will test your patience, skill, and determination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frustrating, yet fair gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk of starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based launching mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References to iconic places, series, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic and emotional ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the top?</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Puig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/cbea8dae1bffc45eae53a2fe0990a3894fe2cf6c.jpg"},{"name":"1st","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/b37660169dba6ccf9fc5dee6ba245ae6059ab6b6.jpg"},{"name":"Childhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/39770f1420266132ec66c701cdad1d2016e1a73b.jpg"},{"name":"<= 5:00","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/56a8868e26ee713d1015ff8f896f7f3c40f064b6.jpg"},{"name":"<= 150","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/62e18985d215dd5776772d9a1f52e31a66017f5a.jpg"},{"name":"Hotel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3593180/81b3d6e88954b05e758501df4e1a654ec438fef5.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593180?t=1